<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean petrochem shrs surge after U.S. explosion.</title>
<headline>S.Korean petrochem shrs surge after U.S. explosion.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean petrochemical shares jumped in early morning on Thursday on expectations of benefits following a Shell Oil chemical plant explosion near Houston earlier this week, brokers said. Honam Petrochemical rose to its daily limit high of 13,000 won, up 900.</p>
</text>
